<http://example.org/dectective/profile#PretendedJourney> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/dectective/profile#PretendedJourney> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A journey announced but not performed." .
<http://example.org/dectective/profile#PretendedJourney> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/dectective/profile#Journey> .
