<http://example.org/dectective/profile#hasContent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The proposition set communicated (encoded as a named graph). Communicating it does not imply belief." .
<http://example.org/dectective/profile#hasContent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://example.org/dectective/profile#CommunicativeAct> .
<http://example.org/dectective/profile#hasContent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/I4_Proposition_Set> .
