<http://example.org/dectective/profile#hasDefectProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Set of typing defects of a machine. Making it owl:InverseFunctionalProperty encodes Holmes's individuality principle (P116.S01-S02); that axiom is NOT shared: it lives only in the worlds that adopt it." .
<http://example.org/dectective/profile#hasDefectProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://example.org/dectective/profile#Typewriter> .
<http://example.org/dectective/profile#hasOccupation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://example.org/dectective/profile#hasOccupation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E21_Person> .
<http://example.org/dectective/profile#hasOccupation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://example.org/dectective/profile#Occupation> .
<http://example.org/dectective/profile#heldBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://example.org/dectective/profile#heldBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Local shortcut: holder of a belief (CRMinf links it only indirectly via I1/I7 P14 and J2)." .
<http://example.org/dectective/profile#heldBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/I2_Belief> .
